LongMemEval Benchmarker TODOs

# ✅ Completed: Three-Class Architecture Refactor

## What Was Done

### Phase 1: Created AgentBuilder ✅
- Created `agent_builder.py` file
- Moved MCP client setup from MycelianMemoryAgent
- Moved tool loading logic from MycelianMemoryAgent
- Moved LLM initialization from MycelianMemoryAgent
- Incorporated PromptBuilder functionality (reusing existing class)
- Initialize helper objects (ToolLogger, StateDebugger, MessageLogger)
- `build()` method returns complete AgentMessageProcessor pipeline

### Phase 2: Created Agent Class ✅
- Created `agent.py` file with focused graph definition
- Accepts dependencies in constructor (llm, tools, prompt, checkpointer)
- Moved graph building logic from GraphBuilder into Agent._build_graph()
- Defined nodes (llm_call, tool_node) as methods
- Defined edges and conditional logic (should_continue)
- Compiles graph in constructor
- Exposes compiled_graph property for processor to use

### Phase 3: Created AgentMessageProcessor ✅
- Created `agent_message_processor.py` file
- Moved all message processing logic from MycelianMemoryAgent
- Accepts Agent instance and helpers in constructor
- Implemented invoke_message() method with full pipeline
- Handles session management and thread context
- Manages debug state dumping

### Phase 4: Updated Build Function ✅
- Removed redundant `factory.py` file
- Added `build_agent()` convenience function to AgentBuilder
- AgentBuilder.build() returns complete pipeline
- Updated __init__.py exports

## Current Architecture

```
agent/
  agent_builder.py           # Sets up infrastructure, returns full pipeline
  agent.py                   # Defines agent behavior (graph topology)
  agent_message_processor.py # Handles message processing runtime
  tool_logger.py            # Helper for logging (unchanged)
  state_debugger.py         # Helper for debugging (unchanged)
  message_logger.py         # Helper for message logging (unchanged)
  prompt_builder.py         # Helper for prompt building (unchanged)
  __init__.py               # Exports new architecture
  
  # Legacy (still present for backward compatibility)
  mycelian_memory_agent.py  # Old monolithic class
  graph_builder.py          # Old graph builder
```

