## Key Achievements

✅ **Clean Separation of Concerns**
- AgentBuilder: Infrastructure setup only
- Agent: Graph definition only  
- AgentMessageProcessor: Runtime only

✅ **Code Reuse**
- All helper classes used as-is
- PromptBuilder integrated without changes
- Logic extracted verbatim from original

✅ **LangGraph Alignment**
- Compiled graph IS the agent
- Proper terminology throughout
- Follows LangGraph patterns

✅ **Maintainability**
- Each class has ONE responsibility
- No circular dependencies
- Clear dependency flow

✅ **Backward Compatibility**
- Old code still works
- Same public API (build_agent function)
- Can migrate gradually